  "title": {
   "en": "Friend Counter"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "友達カウンター"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "“If you can’t even control how many friends you have… then you’ve got no future!!”\n\nHayato Makabe, a broke and friendless high schooler, finds his mundane life upended when a mysterious man in a lab coat suddenly appears in his classroom. He distributes strange contact lenses that, once worn, reveal a number floating above each student’s head: their actual number of friends.\n\nThen comes the shocking announcement:\n\n“In 24 hours, the student with the lowest number… will die.”\n\nThus begins the brutal “Friendship Severance Project,” a secret death game run directly by the government."
  },
